does that serve for us?

790
00:42:59,065 --> 00:43:01,299
- Keeps them from killing her.
- [sighs]

791
00:43:01,300 --> 00:43:03,135
Then we WitPro her.

792
00:43:03,235 --> 00:43:05,137
Or we don't.

793
00:43:05,237 --> 00:43:06,873
And we trot her out
on national television

794
00:43:06,973 --> 00:43:08,374
and we scream it
from the rooftops.

795
00:43:08,474 --> 00:43:11,210
- Have you seen her asset list?
- [sighs]

796
00:43:12,444 --> 00:43:14,512
Have you?

797
00:43:14,513 --> 00:43:17,116
Yeah. Yeah, I've seen it.

798
00:43:20,219 --> 00:43:22,154
- And, Kyle?
- [scoffs]

799
00:43:22,288 --> 00:43:23,822
You know
I can't tell you that, Joe.

800
00:43:23,823 --> 00:43:25,323
You got the same clearance I do.

801
00:43:25,324 --> 00:43:26,793
- Go to SAC and request it.
- Spare me

802
00:43:26,893 --> 00:43:28,494
the three fucking hours
