803
00:43:28,627 --> 00:43:29,829
You're gonna have
to look at it yourself,

804
00:43:29,929 --> 00:43:31,663
but it's pretty fucking heavy.

805
00:43:31,664 --> 00:43:34,166
Just tell me, Kyle.

806
00:43:37,837 --> 00:43:40,239
