807
00:43:42,374 --> 00:43:43,876
Someone from NSA.

808
00:43:44,777 --> 00:43:46,678
JSOC.

809
00:43:46,679 --> 00:43:48,347
[sighs]

810
00:43:48,480 --> 00:43:49,882
Senator.

811
00:43:51,684 --> 00:43:53,352
Senator?

812
00:43:56,488 --> 00:43:58,190
Did you count
how many times I nodded?

813
00:43:59,058 --> 00:44:00,126
I counted five.

814
00:44:00,226 --> 00:44:03,730
And that is why
we can't out her.

815
00:44:03,830 --> 00:44:06,432
'Cause the fucking sky falls.

816
00:44:06,532 --> 00:44:08,134
Well, isn't that the goal?

817
00:44:08,234 --> 00:44:09,401
Maybe.

818
00:44:09,535 --> 00:44:11,070
You comfortable with the price?

819
