821
00:44:14,941 --> 00:44:17,777
Well, turn on the fucking news,
Kyle, we're already there.

822
00:44:18,610 --> 00:44:20,212
I want
to run it up the flagpole.

823
00:44:20,312 --> 00:44:22,248
