- Will you back me up on this?

824
00:44:22,381 --> 00:44:24,050
I don't think putting her
on the news is the play,

825
00:44:24,183 --> 00:44:25,752
but there may be a way to run
the rats out of the outhouse--

826
00:44:25,852 --> 00:44:27,153
Well, why don't we just
discuss that en route?

827
00:44:27,253 --> 00:44:28,420
You got it.

828
00:44:28,520 --> 00:44:30,589
[Amber speaking indistinctly]

829
