Come on in.

836
00:45:08,560 --> 00:45:09,796
Evening.

837
00:45:09,929 --> 00:45:11,096
What do you got, Joe?

838
00:45:11,097 --> 00:45:12,298
[sighs]

839
00:45:12,431 --> 00:45:14,000
We're allowing Oleksandra
to stay under?

840
00:45:14,100 --> 00:45:16,435
- [Meade] Mm-hmm.
- Correct.

841
00:45:16,535 --> 00:45:19,137
What is the tactical purpose
of that?

842
00:45:19,138 --> 00:45:21,373
Have you seen her dossier
of gets?

843
00:45:21,473 --> 00:45:24,276
- I have not, sir.
- Pretty impressive haul.

844
00:45:24,977 --> 00:45:27,179
[clears throat]

845
00:45:41,961 --> 00:45:45,097
Has information or votes
they cast benefited Russia

846
00:45:45,197 --> 00:45:46,298
since she snagged them?

847
00:45:46,432 --> 00:45:47,666
[Westfield]
No, not in any manner

848
00:45:47,766 --> 00:45:49,068
our analysts can determine, no.

849
00:45:49,168 --> 00:45:51,270
All five have
publicly supported Ukraine

850
00:45:51,370 --> 00:45:53,105
and voted in favor
of each aid package

851
00:45:53,205 --> 00:45:55,875
Congress has introduced.

852
00:45:55,975 --> 00:45:57,343
Which isn't surprising, Joe.

853
00:45:57,476 --> 00:45:59,545
Her allegiance is to Ukraine.
She's not going

854
00:45:59,645 --> 00:46:01,848
to knowingly bring material harm
to her nation.

855
00:46:01,981 --> 00:46:03,115
How were the assets obtained?

856
00:46:03,215 --> 00:46:04,817
Four were soft, one was hard.

857
00:46:04,917 --> 00:46:06,986
How soft and how hard?

858
00:46:07,086 --> 00:46:08,319
[Meade]
Campaign funds for two,

859
00:46:08,320 --> 00:46:09,688
heavy investment
in one's district,

860
00:46:09,822 --> 00:46:11,657
