runs an investment firm.

861
00:46:11,757 --> 00:46:15,194
She married that firm
to a Russian investment fund.

862
00:46:15,294 --> 00:46:18,197
The fourth,
the old-fashioned way.

863
00:46:19,999 --> 00:46:22,268
- [Kyle exhales]
- [Westfield] It's not our job

864
00:46:22,368 --> 00:46:24,003
to walk you through intel, Joe.

865
00:46:26,805 --> 00:46:29,708
I think we should inform Russia
that we have their agent.

866
00:46:30,776 --> 00:46:32,311
We're waiting on their call.

867
00:46:32,411 --> 00:46:34,513
If we reach out, it alludes
to an interest in negotiating.

868
00:46:34,613 --> 00:46:36,048
It gives them leverage.

869
00:46:36,148 --> 00:46:38,050
Not the one we took.

870
00:46:39,485 --> 00:46:41,587
Let them know we have her.

871
00:46:41,687 --> 00:46:43,355
And inform them
through a statement

872
