894
00:47:33,639 --> 00:47:36,708
Hunting mice by setting the barn
on fire, so to speak.

895
00:47:36,808 --> 00:47:37,709
Yes, ma'am.

896
00:47:37,809 --> 00:47:39,745
Of course, at the end of that,

897
00:47:39,878 --> 00:47:41,412
