900
00:47:45,717 --> 00:47:47,920
She used us from the beginning.

901
00:47:48,020 --> 00:47:50,589
We let her use us.
We used her right back.

902
00:47:50,689 --> 00:47:52,992
Why stop now?

903
00:47:53,092 --> 00:47:54,493
[sighs]

904
00:47:54,593 --> 00:47:57,796
You will never convince me
the men at my home found me

905
