908
00:48:03,169 --> 00:48:05,603
Either she did it
or she knows who did it.

909
00:48:05,604 --> 00:48:07,272
They think of themselves
as wolves.

910
00:48:07,273 --> 00:48:11,944
Fine, let's throw her back
to the wolves... and find out.

911
00:48:19,285 --> 00:48:20,719
Let me sleep on it.

912
00:48:24,123 --> 00:48:25,524
Thank you.

913
