Which way you think
he'll go on this?

915
00:48:36,135 --> 00:48:37,136
He's already decided.

916
00:48:37,236 --> 00:48:38,937
Eh, I think he's 50-50.

917
00:48:39,038 --> 00:48:40,306
He's already decided.

918
00:48:40,439 --> 00:48:41,840
You don't sleep on a "no."

919
